# ApplyOS

**The AI Job Application System. Wake up to jobs found, tailored, and ready to send.**

A Cowork plugin that runs daily at 7:00 AM. It searches LinkedIn, Welcome to the Jungle, and JobTeaser for jobs matching your criteria, scores each one against your soul document, and builds full application packs (CV + cover letter + company POV + cold DM + interview prep) ready to send. By the time you wake up, your top 3 jobs per direction are pack-ready in Notion and the editable .docx and .pdf files are waiting in your local folder.

> Part I taught you how to apply to a job in 15 minutes.
> Part II teaches the system to do it while you sleep.

---

## Install

Download the plugin and drag it into Cowork.

**[Download applyos-v0.2.plugin](https://github.com/samuelsaleh/applyos/raw/main/applyos-v0.2.plugin)**

After install, run `/applyos:setup` in Cowork. The command walks you through the entire setup in 30 to 60 minutes:
- Build your soul document (one-time AI interview)
- Capture hunt criteria (cities, role keywords, salary, languages, dealbreakers)
- Ingest your base CVs
- Personalize the Daily Job Hunter skill
- Connect the Notion template
- Generate your master schedule prompt

That's it. Tomorrow morning at 07:00 the system fires its first run.

---

## What's inside

**7 skills**

| Skill | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Company Research | Researches a company from any JD using web search |
| CV Optimizer | Produces edit list to tailor your CV per role |
| Cover Letter Writer | Writes a tailored cover letter under 400 words |
| Job Application Workflow | Orchestrates the manual application flow |
| Daily Job Hunter | Searches LinkedIn, WTTJ, JobTeaser, scores against soul doc |
| Application Packager | For top 3 per direction, runs all Part I skills automatically |
| Notion Sync | Writes every job to your Notion Jobs database |

**2 slash commands**

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/applyos:setup` | One-shot onboarding (run once after install) |
| `/applyos:jobhunt-run` | Fire the daily hunt on demand |

---

## Daily output

Once configured, every weekday at 7:00 AM:

- **Notion** — every found job becomes a row with files attached, full pack in the sub-page
- **Local cv folder** — editable `.docx` + ready-to-send `.pdf` for top 3 per direction, organized by date and direction
- **Inbox** — daily digest email at 7:05 with top 3 highlighted

You wake up, scan Notion, fire 3 to 5 applications. 15 minutes total.

---

## Honest limits

- Does not auto-apply. You still hit the button.
- Does not scrape LinkedIn behind login walls (uses the public Google index).
- Does not replace your network.
- Does not invent experiences.

This is decision support, not automation.

